      "decision": "The whole patch adds markForCheck after onTouched inside the existing callback guard. Untouched16 only calls onTouched;the current owned legacy group on both lines already calls the supplied ChangeDetectorRef after the callback. Its FocusMonitor blur subscription reaches this method. Actual owned class execution preserves callback-before-mark and skips marking without a callback;removing the mark is detected. Both exact current Material minima have since evolved to a callback-only modern group,so inheritance/tag ancestry is not the justification. Retain the legacy adaptation. The older read note describes the pre-adaptation state and is preserved rather than rewritten. Native OnPush rendering is separately prepared for final artifact-bound Actions;this source algorithm decision does not claim that execution.",
